commit f5e35938a26fffce5bf3c0d04514b83322fc1564
Author: Rafael Mendonça França <rafael@rubyonrails.org>
Date:   Fri Nov 27 12:50:32 2026 -0500

    Replace redundant Symbol conversions with to_s
    
    Active Support makes Symbol#to_s return the same frozen string as
    Symbol#name. Use to_s where both branches convert a value to a string.
    
    Keep type checks where callers must preserve non-Symbol values.
    Keep Symbol#to_param for callers that require that extension alone.
    
    References #59369.

